        "content": "...Off he goes."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] Are you oka—",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "Are you oka—"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] What have you done! Oh, God, Talulah... Look at what you've done!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "What have you done! Oh, God, Talulah... Look at what you've done!"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] Talulah, we'll have to transport the village in two days. Just look at what you've...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "Talulah, we'll have to transport the village in two days. Just look at what you've...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] You fought a patrolman! There'll be hell to pay now!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "You fought a patrolman! There'll be hell to pay now!"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] Letting him beat you was even less of an idea. It's getting late, and he's on the run. If I kill him now, we'll be long gone by the time the others find his remains.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "Letting him beat you was even less of an idea. It's getting late, and he's on the run. If I kill him now, we'll be long gone by the time the others find his remains."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] But that wouldn't solve any of our problems. Once the patrol unit regroups, they'd still come looking for us. They might well be out to get revenge on us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "But that wouldn't solve any of our problems. Once the patrol unit regroups, they'd still come looking for us. They might well be out to get revenge on us."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] And yet you did it! Now what do we do!?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "And yet you did it! Now what do we do!?"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] Calm down. They're looking for Infected. They still don't know.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "Calm down. They're looking for Infected. They still don't know."
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] Don't know what?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "Don't know what?"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] They don't know what I'm about to do.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "They don't know what I'm about to do."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] Hey... Talulah!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "Hey... Talulah!"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] It's okay. Come on, I'll walk you back.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "It's okay. Come on, I'll walk you back."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Talulah\"] Your leg there... It will need special attention to heal.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Talulah",
        "content": "Your leg there... It will need special attention to heal."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] Hah. So today's the day you start helping me walk? Always thought I was still in good shape myself. Who'd've guessed I couldn't outrun it?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "Hah. So today's the day you start helping me walk? Always thought I was still in good shape myself. Who'd've guessed I couldn't outrun it?"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Old Man\"] Talulah, there's something I need to tell you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Old Man",
        "content": "Talulah, there's something I need to tell you."
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_092#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
